        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Customer as Customer (Client)\n    participant Security as Security Filter\n    participant Controller\n    participant Service\n    participant Repo\n    participant DB\n\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;Security: DELETE /api/v1/cart/items/{cartItemId}\n    Note over Security: Validate JWT &amp; extract customerId\n    \n    Security-&gt;&gt;Controller: removeItem(cartItemId, customerId)\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: removeItemFromCart(cartItemId, customerId)\n    \n    Service-&gt;&gt;Repo: deleteByIdAndCustomerId(cartItemId, customerId)\n    Repo-&gt;&gt;DB: DELETE FROM cart_item WHERE cart_item_id = ? AND cart_id = (SELECT cart_id FROM cart WHERE customer_id = ?)\n    \n    alt Delete Count &gt; 0\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repo: 1 row affected\n        Repo--&gt;&gt;Service: 1\n        Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Success\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Customer: 200 Success\n    else Delete Count == 0\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repo: 0 rows affected\n        Repo--&gt;&gt;Service: 0\n        Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Throw ResourceNotFoundException\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Customer: 404 Not Found\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="xW3aXfIS033Qgl_fGo8g-58">
